# Homepage writes default config files (kubernetes.yaml, bookmarks.yaml,
# custom.css/js, proxmox.yaml, …) and a logs/ dir into this folder on first run.
# Track only the curated config; ignore everything Homepage generates so the
# host's git stays clean.
*
!.gitignore
!settings.yaml
!widgets.yaml
!services.yaml
!docker.yaml
!bookmarks.yaml
!custom.css
